    feat: add full asset pack + visual system foundation for Stranded Horizons
    
    Added a complete set of new game assets and defined a unified visual style
    to support upcoming gameplay features (enemy variety, pickups, UI, effects, etc.)
    
    ---
    
    🎨 GLOBAL ART STYLE
    
    All assets were generated using a consistent style:
    
    top-down 2D game asset, stylized, clean shapes, soft shading, high contrast,
    readable silhouette, minimal details, slightly cartoonish, vibrant colors,
    transparent background, no text, no watermark, centered object
    
    ---
    
    👾 NEW ENEMY ASSETS
    
    - assets/enemy-basic.png
    Prompt:
    top-down view of a small hostile creature, simple rounded shape, slightly dark color palette, glowing eyes, basic enemy design, easy to recognize, not too detailed, game asset, transparent background
    
    - assets/enemy-fast.png
    Prompt:
    top-down view of a fast agile enemy, slim body, sharp edges, slightly smaller than normal enemy, bright accent color, dynamic aggressive look, designed to feel quick and dangerous, game asset, transparent background
